  <item nodeId="node-86">
    <command xml:space="preserve">1</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">"My name is Joe Schmoe and Inform hates me."&#x000A;&#x000A;[1] Why does Inform hate you?&#x000A;[2] I don't care.&#x000A;[3] Ha, ha. Inform hates you.&#x000A;[4] Do you like a monkey?&#x000A;[5] Only crazy people like monkeys.&#x000A;[6] Say nothing&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
